  "sourceTitle": "Ripe Tomato Relish Or Chow - Chow",
  "sourceText": "Ripe Tomato Relish Or Chow - Chow\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Monday, November 30, 2009 - 11:29pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 gal. ripe tomatoes, chopped\n1 gal. cabbage, chopped\n1 qt. onions, chopped\n2 peppers green/red), chopped\n1 cup salt\n1/2 gal. vinegar\n2 1/2 pounds sugar\n2 teaspoons turmeric\n1 teaspoon cinnamon\n1 teaspoon cloves\n2 teaspoons celery seed\n2 teaspoons white mustard\n2 teaspoons ginger\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine tomatoes, cabbage, onions, peppers and salt. Let set overnight. The next day drain, add other ingredients. Cook 1 hour. Pour in jars and seal.",
